              "name": "Judy Rossi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was delicious. I made according to the recipe, but added 1/4 C flour to the filling because my ricotta was very soft.\nI rolled out my crust and made a lattice top, so the bottom crust was not too thick. If you cannot manage a lattice top crust, I would suggest at least rolling (not patting) the bottom crust. My family raved about this pie.",
